{
  "abstract": "This paper presents the results of the analysis of a single-arm inelastic-electron-scattering experiment at an angle of 4\u00b0. We present data on the turnon of scaling in the low-q2 region 0.1<q2<1.8, the neutron-proton comparison at large values of the scaling variable \u03c9, resonance excitation, and the shadowing in scattering from heavy nuclei.",
